{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"dengzhang-p2-heshuang","name":"何双","evidence":["dengzhang-q2-45c05d9414e70d5d5be1"],"facts":[{"id":"dengzhang-f2-78d9d068e7cb5a728582","text":"何双为何宗子，字汉偶，为双柏长，早卒。","evidence":["dengzhang-q2-45c05d9414e70d5d5be1"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q2-45c05d9414e70d5d5be1","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-5b88ec2a3e6dbc52915f","layer":"original","quote":"何彦英名宗，蜀郡郫人也。事广汉任安学，精究安术；与杜琼同师，而名问过之〖71〗。刘璋时，为犍为太守。先主定益州，领牧，辟为从事祭酒〖72〗。后援引图谶，劝先主即尊号。践阼之后，迁为大鸿胪。建兴中卒。失其行事，故不为传。子双，字汉偶。滑稽谈笑，有淳于髡、东方朔之风〖73〗。为双柏长〖74〗。早卒。","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
